    "GitHub may ask you to choose Bug Report or Feature Request first. For pairing or connection problems, open Connection Health and use Copy Diagnostics. Do not include pairing records, credentials or private locations." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "前往 GitHub 提交 Bug 反馈或功能建议。若遇配对或连接问题，可在“连接健康诊断”中点击“复制诊断信息”。切勿随报告上传配对密钥凭据或私人敏感位置。"
          }
